{"nodes": [{"id": "plans_2026_09_01_phase_0a_foundation_plan", "label": "Phase 0a Foundation Implementation Plan", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-01-phase-0a-foundation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Twelve tasks replacing the deleted Node prototype with a Rust workspace, a TanStack SPA and a four-service stack that serves a health-checked page, with the layering rule in CI from the first commit. Names superpowers:subagent-driven-development as the required sub-skill."}, {"id": "plans_2026_09_01_phase_0a_foundation_global_constraints", "label": "Plan Global Constraints", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-01-phase-0a-foundation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Restates the project rules as per-task requirements: no SQL outside lapidary-db enforced by deny.toml wrappers, lapidary-api never gaining a main.rs, no unwrap() outside tests via #![deny(clippy::unwrap_used)], anyhow only in bin/ and xtask/, dark-only frontend, every string through strings.ts, STORED generated columns, and cargo fmt before every Rust commit since the plan's code blocks are written for readability rather than rustfmt output."}, {"id": "plans_2026_09_01_phase_0a_foundation_pinned_versions", "label": "Pinned Version Table And Split Pinning Mechanism", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-01-phase-0a-foundation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Cargo.toml uses ordinary caret requirements with Cargo.lock as the pin \u2014 idiomatic Cargo and what cargo deny checks \u2014 while package.json uses exact versions with no caret and commits package-lock.json, because npm's resolution is looser. Each internal path dependency carries an explicit version, or cargo records it as * and deny.toml's wildcards=deny rejects every crate-to-crate edge in the workspace."}, {"id": "plans_2026_09_01_phase_0a_foundation_file_structure", "label": "Plan File Structure Table", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-01-phase-0a-foundation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Path-by-responsibility map: newtype ids and Approximate<T> in lapidary-core, repository traits as the only crate that may name sqlx, the Kernel trait and MockKernel, router() as a library, xtask/src/layers.rs holding the rule pure and unit-testable, and web/src/bindings committed so CI can detect staleness."}, {"id": "plans_2026_09_01_phase_0a_foundation_task_check_layers", "label": "Task 3: xtask check-layers", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-01-phase-0a-foundation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A custom xtask parsing cargo metadata to enforce the tier rule, written as a pure unit-testable function so the rule itself can be tested rather than only observed in CI."}, {"id": "plans_2026_09_01_phase_0a_foundation_task_kernel_mock", "label": "Task 5: Kernel Trait And MockKernel", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-01-phase-0a-foundation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "An in-process MockKernel behind the trait; the real OCCT sidecar is Phase 0b and nothing in this plan depends on it."}, {"id": "plans_2026_09_01_phase_0a_foundation_task_ts_rs_pipeline", "label": "Task 8: ts-rs Export Pipeline", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-01-phase-0a-foundation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One source of truth for wire types. uuid-impl and jiff-impl are not optional extras \u2014 without them ts-rs has no TS impl for Uuid or jiff::Timestamp and lapidary-core does not compile."}, {"id": "plans_2026_09_01_phase_0a_foundation_task_container_images", "label": "Task 10: Container Images And The Compose Stack", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-01-phase-0a-foundation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Rust multi-stage to lapidary-server, postgres:18 plus pgvector, node build to caddy static serve, and a four-service compose file with no Redis and no broker. OCCT is Phase 0b and deliberately absent."}, {"id": "plans_2026_09_01_phase_0a_foundation_task_ci_supply_chain", "label": "Task 11: CI And Supply Chain", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-01-phase-0a-foundation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "AGPL-3.0-only, not the bare deprecated AGPL-3.0 id, or cargo-deny rejects all fourteen of our own crates while passing every third-party one. The sqlx wrapper list confines SQL to lapidary-db; lapidary-api appears only because #[sqlx::test] is a dev-dependency, and if that list grows further, SQL has leaked."}, {"id": "plans_2026_09_01_phase_0a_foundation_task_exit_verification", "label": "Task 12: Exit-Criteria Verification", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-01-phase-0a-foundation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Eight checks, including proving the layering check fails on an injected violation rather than only passing, verifying pgvector and the Turkish config, confirming bindings and the route tree track their sources, checking the LICENSE file agrees with the prose around it, and running under Docker as well as Podman with both ignore files present or the context is the whole repo."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_roadmap_phase_0", "target": "plans_2026_09_01_phase_0a_foundation_plan", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-01-phase-0a-foundation.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "plans_2026_09_01_phase_0a_foundation_plan", "target": "docs_prototype_notes_domain_shape", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-01-phase-0a-foundation.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "plans_2026_09_01_phase_0a_foundation_plan", "target": "docs_prototype_notes_vertex_clustering_lod", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-01-phase-0a-foundation.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "plans_2026_09_01_phase_0a_foundation_plan", "target": "docs_prototype_notes_not_carried_forward", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-01-phase-0a-foundation.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "plans_2026_09_01_phase_0a_foundation_plan", "target": "docs_architecture_crate_graph", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-01-phase-0a-foundation.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "plans_2026_09_01_phase_0a_foundation_global_constraints", "target": "claude_lapidary_working_rules", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-01-phase-0a-foundation.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "plans_2026_09_01_phase_0a_foundation_global_constraints", "targe